  "implementationBoundary": "Design complete; application implementation remains dependency-gated by the active P9-06 sequence, especially persistence, authoritative sessions, checkpoint, backup, restore, provider-exit, migration, permission, and entitlement foundations. No paid service, production credential, production deployment, internal-alpha release, public release, or broad offline authoritative mutation is authorized."
